    "summary": "Many breaches now begin in places where no software vulnerability exists to patch, and an increasing share of them run through a vendor, partner, or external dependency.Verizon’s 2026 Data Breach Investigations Report, which examined more than 22,000 confirmed breaches from a dataset of over 31,000... Read More",
